" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{T}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\)</span> 是公理 T 的全部代入实例。</li>\n<li>&quot;若我知道<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>为真&quot;</li>\n<li>对应自反框架性质</li>\n<li>GL不包含T（可证性不意味着真）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-t-axiom-—-Axiom-T-(Factivity)","text":"df-t-axiom — Axiom T (Factivity)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4"